fault) posts a visibility card to Group C\n            with a ``[Dream]`` prefix. Set False for silent submission.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = feishu_group_mod.submit_dream_review_report(\n        report=report,\n        project=project,\n        tier=tier,\n        dream_id=dream_id,\n        overall_score=overall_score,\n        review_chat_id=review_chat_id,\n        review_visible=review_visible,\n    )\n    return _tool_result_to_str(result)\n\n\n@mcp.tool()\ndef request_external_review(\n    project: str,\n    paper_pdf_path: str,","numLines":50,"startLine":4912,"totalLines":5855}}}
